      ],
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "content": "The HC-SR04 (2020 version) is an open ultrasonic ranging module with the same dimensions as the earlier version and added UART and IIC functions. Its software and hardware are fully compatible with the earlier HC-SR04 by default; resistors can select UART or IIC mode. It features a 2 CM minimum blind zone, a typical maximum range of 4.5 M, and a 2.2 mA operating current. The upgraded RCWL-9206 demodulation chip and MCU with UART and IIC functions simplify peripheral circuitry, extend the supply range to 3-5.5 V, and provide more interfaces."
        }
      ]
    },
