      ],
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "table",
          "content": "| Command | Return value | Description |\n|--------|----------------------|-----------------------------------------------------------------|\n| 0XA0 | BYTE_H BYTE_M BYTE_L | Output distance: ((BYTE_H<<16)+(BYTE_M<<8)+ BYTE_L)/1000 mm |\n| 0XF1 | | Company and version information |"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Connect the serial port. The external MCU or PC sends 0XA0. After measuring, the module returns three distance bytes: BYTE_H, BYTE_M, and BYTE_L."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Distance is calculated as follows (mm):"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Distance=((BYTE_H<<16)+(BYTE_M<<8)+ BYTE_L)/1000"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
